2026-11-12T04:24:46.3655500Z 
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3655960Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3656490Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3660290Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3660870Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3661230Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3661580Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3662060Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3662560Z    /var/root
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3669730Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3670250Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3728970Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3734710Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3736850Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-12T04:24:46.3749210Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
